{"meta":{"id":"locust-traffic-test","category":"it/server/infra/load-test","title":"트래픽 테스트 (Locust)","subtitle":"","summary":"Locust 로 가상 사용자 300명까지 늘려 응답 시간과 처리량(RPS) 측정","tags":["locust","부하 테스트","트래픽","rps","python","성능"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"test_setting","updatedAt":"2025-02-07"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>LOCUST</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-02-07</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">트래픽 테스트 (Locust)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> Locust 로 가상 사용자 300명까지 늘려 응답 시간과 처리량(RPS) 측정</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">개요</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Python 부하 테스트 도구 <strong>Locust</strong> 로 가상 사용자를 늘려 가며 서버가 버티는 요청 수와 응답 시간을 측정합니다. 사용자 행동을 locustfile.py 에 파이썬 코드로 정의하고, 웹 UI 나 headless 모드로 실행합니다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">파일</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">locustfile.py</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가상 사용자 정의 — 로그인 후 토큰으로 상품 페이지 요청</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">locust_results_stats.csv</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">요청별 합계 (요청 수, 실패 수, 응답 시간 백분위, RPS)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">locust_results_stats_history.csv</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1초 간격 시계열 (사용자 수, RPS, 응답 시간)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">locust_results_failures.csv / exceptions.csv</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">실패 · 예외 기록 (이번 결과는 비어 있음)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">설치와 실행</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">pip install locust\r\n\r\n# 웹 UI 로 실행 → http://localhost:8089 에서 사용자 수 / 증가 속도 입력\r\nlocust -f locustfile.py\r\n\r\n# UI 없이 실행하고 결과를 csv 로 저장 (locust_results_*.csv)\r\nlocust -f locustfile.py --headless -u 300 -r 5 -t 1m --host http://localhost:8080 --csv=locust_results</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">-u: 최대 사용자 수, -r: 초당 늘릴 사용자 수, -t: 실행 시간, --csv: 결과 파일 이름 앞부분</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">locustfile.py (로그인 → 상품 페이지)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">from locust import HttpUser, task, between\r\n\r\n\r\nclass MyUser(HttpUser):\r\n    wait_time = between(1, 5)\r\n    \r\n    def on_start(self):\r\n        self.login()\r\n\r\n    def login(self):\r\n        response = self.client.post(\r\n            &quot;http://localhost:9090/javaProjectj7/LoginCk.u&quot;, \r\n            data={&quot;mid&quot;: &quot;&lt;아이디&gt;&quot;, &quot;pswd&quot;: &quot;&lt;비밀번호&gt;&quot;}\r\n        )\r\n\r\n        if response.status_code == 200:\r\n            # 토큰을 받아서 저장\r\n            self.auth_token = response.json().get(&quot;auth_token&quot;)\r\n            print(&quot;로그인 성공, 토큰을 받았습니다.&quot;)\r\n            logging.info(f&quot;로그인 성공 (토큰)&quot;)\r\n        else:\r\n            logging.info(f&quot;로그인 실패 &quot;)\r\n\r\n\r\n    @task\r\n    def buy_product(self):\r\n        # 토큰을 헤더에 추가하여 요청 보내기\r\n        headers = {\r\n            &quot;Authorization&quot;: f&quot;Bearer {self.auth_token}&quot;,\r\n            &quot;Cache-Control&quot;: &quot;no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate&quot;\r\n        }\r\n        response = self.client.get(\r\n            &quot;http://localhost:9090/javaProjectj7/BuyProductView.bp&quot;,\r\n            headers=headers\r\n        )\r\n\r\n        if response.status_code == 200:\r\n            logging.info(f&quot;상품 페이지 로드 성공&quot;)\r\n        else:\r\n            logging.info(f&quot;상품 페이지 로드 실패&quot;)</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">on_start 에서 로그인해 토큰을 받고, @task 에서 Bearer 토큰을 붙여 상품 페이지를 반복 요청합니다. 사용자마다 1~5초씩 쉬었다가 다음 요청을 보냅니다. (로그인 정보는 가림)</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-700 font-semibold\">※ 코드에서 logging 을 쓰지만 import logging 이 빠져 있어, 실행하려면 맨 위에 추가해야 합니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">결과 (2025-02-07)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">값</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">요청 수 / 실패 수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3,144 / 0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">최대 동시 사용자</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">300명 (초당 약 5명씩 증가)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">최대 처리량</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">91.5 [RPS] (요청/초)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">응답 시간 (중앙값 / 평균)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">6 ms / 68.4 ms</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">응답 시간 (95% / 99% / 최대)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">270 ms / 290 ms / 2,287 ms</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">평균 응답 크기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">644 bytes</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">※ 결과 csv 는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>GET /</code> 요청 기준입니다. 현재 locustfile.py(로그인 → 상품 페이지)보다 앞선 버전으로 측정한 결과입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">사용자 증가에 따른 변화</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">경과</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">사용자</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">RPS</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">50%(ms)</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">95%(ms)</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">99%(ms)</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">누적 요청</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">실패</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">50초</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">45</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">8.4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">250</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">270</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2300</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">86</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">60초</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">95</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">22.0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">16</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">270</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">280</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">346</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">70초</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">145</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">36.6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">10</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">270</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">320</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">763</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">80초</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">195</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">53.2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">270</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">290</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1330</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">90초</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">245</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">70.5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">270</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">290</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2096</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">100초</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">295</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">88.5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">270</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">290</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3016</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">105초</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">91.5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">6</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">270</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">290</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3144</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">사용자가 늘어도 중앙값은 6~16ms, 95% 는 270ms 수준으로 유지되었고 실패는 없었습니다. 처음 몇 초의 긴 응답(최대 약 2.3초)은 서버 워밍업 구간입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">관련 문서</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">노트북 서버 부하 결과(250 RPS 기점 실패 증가)는 <strong>서버 › 인프라 › 서버 구성 (노트북)</strong>, Statement / PreparedStatement 비교는 <strong>프로그램 언어 › JAVA › JAVA DB 통신 속도 비교</strong> 에 있습니다.</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/load-test/locust-traffic-test","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"load-test","title":"부하 · 속도 측정","path":"it/server/infra/load-test"}],"hasImage":false}